   "memberGrade": null,
   "createdAt": "2025-11-28T05:03:44.000Z",
   "createdAtMs": 1764306224000,
   "text": "오 접수신청하고나서 얼마까지 쓰셨어요??",
   "isAuthor": true,
   "isOperator": false,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "sourceType": "CAFE_COMMENT"
  },
  {
   "commentId": 54567771,
   "parentCommentId": 54567628,
   "author": "나나부실차주가자",
   "memberGrade": null,
   "createdAt": "2025-11-28T05:05:55.000Z",
   "createdAtMs": 1764306355000,
   "text": "신청전에 다썼어요\n현금서비스.남은거 백인가.이백인가랑\n카드찔끔남은한도 다썼어요",
   "isAuthor": false,
   "isOperator": false,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "sourceType": "CAFE_COMMENT"
  },
  {
   "commentId": 54567876,
   "parentCommentId": 54567628,
   "author": "다꾸아이아",
   "memberGrade": null,
   "createdAt": "2025-11-28T05:14:45.000Z",
   "createdAtMs": 1764306885000,
   "text": "아 신청전에 쓰셨구나 전 오늘 신청했는데 쓰면 안되려나여 ㅜㅜ",
   "isAuthor": true,
   "isOperator": false,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "sourceType": "CAFE_COMMENT"
  },
  {
   "commentId": 54568028,
   "parentCommentId": 54567628,
   "author": "나나부실차주가자",
   "memberGrade": null,
   "createdAt": "2025-11-28T05:30:42.000Z",
   "createdAtMs": 1764307842000,
   "text": "괜히찝찝함 쓰지말아요 ㅜㅜㅜ",
   "isAuthor": false,
   "isOperator": false,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "sourceType": "CAFE_COMMENT"
